    "notes": "Cairo Poetics: The City as a Poem, by Asmaa Abdellatif. Tentative Flow. Note: The selection of poems to be analyzed will be ﬂexible according to the discussions in every class.\n\nCourse work: Throughout the course, participants will be expected to start working on their own individual works of art (poems, digital art, paintings, photography..etc) in order to be collected and compiled in a digital anthology by the end of the course.\n\nThe Week 2 reading URL for the Guardian article is recorded as both title and href because the flow gives no title for it. Some links appear more than once in the link list; each address is attached to its single material."
